+---
+id: task-004-implement-rfc-7386-json-merge-patch
+type: task
+title: "Implement RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented and exported `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` according to RFC 7386. Object patches
+merge recursively, null members delete object members, object patches coerce non-object targets to
+empty objects, and every other patch value replaces the target atomically.
+
+The function validates and clones both inputs as JSON values, preserving caller input values. Added
+RFC-focused red-first tests for merge/delete behaviour, non-object replacement, recursive creation,
+input validation, independence and `__proto__` member safety. Documented the public API in the
+README and recorded the validation/immutability decision in dl-005.
+
+Validation: `npm test` passes all 23 tests, including TypeScript compilation; `git diff --check`
+passes.
